  "Nmap envía SYN al puerto 8080 y recibe RST. Estado:": "Nmap sends SYN to port 8080 and gets RST. State:",
  "RST = \"el equipo existe, pero aquí no hay nadie\".": "RST = \"the host exists, but nobody's here\".",
  "Nmap envía SYN al puerto 22 y no recibe nada, ni siquiera tras reintentar. Estado:": "Nmap sends SYN to port 22 and gets nothing back, not even after retrying. State:",
  "El silencio es un firewall descartando el paquete.": "Silence means a firewall is dropping the packet.",
  "Nmap envía SYN y recibe un ICMP \"destination unreachable (admin prohibited)\". Estado:": "Nmap sends SYN and gets an ICMP \"destination unreachable (admin prohibited)\". State:",
  "Un router o firewall rechaza el paquete explícitamente: filtrado.": "A router or firewall explicitly rejects the packet: filtered.",
  "En tcpdump ves Flags [S.]. ¿Qué paquete es?": "In tcpdump you see Flags [S.]. Which packet is it?",
  "[S.] = SYN + ACK (el punto es ACK).": "[S.] = SYN + ACK (the dot is ACK).",
  "En tcpdump ves Flags [R.]. ¿Qué paquete es?": "In tcpdump you see Flags [R.]. Which packet is it?",
  "R = reset: la conexión se rechaza o se corta.": "R = reset: the connection is refused or cut off.",
  "En tcpdump ves Flags [S]. ¿Qué paquete es?": "In tcpdump you see Flags [S]. Which packet is it?",
  "Solo S: el primer paso, \"quiero conectarme\".": "Just S: the first step, \"I want to connect\".",
