  "<b>1.</b> /{c} → manzanas de <b>{size}</b> casas.": "<b>1.</b> /{c} → blocks of <b>{size}</b> houses.",
  "<b>2.</b> Con /24 hay una sola manzana (0–255), así que la red es <b>.0</b>.": "<b>2.</b> With /24 there's just one block (0–255), so the network is <b>.0</b>.",
  "<b>2.</b> {o4} ÷ {size} = {dec} → me quedo con <b>{idx}</b> → {idx} × {size} = <b>{start}</b> → red <b>.{start}</b>.": "<b>2.</b> {o4} ÷ {size} = {dec} → I keep <b>{idx}</b> → {idx} × {size} = <b>{start}</b> → network <b>.{start}</b>.",
  "<b>3.</b> Broadcast = red + manzana − 1 = {start} + {size} − 1 = <b>{end}</b>.": "<b>3.</b> Broadcast = network + block − 1 = {start} + {size} − 1 = <b>{end}</b>.",
