  "/{c} son manzanas de {size}. Divide {o4} entre {size}, quédate con la parte entera y multiplícala por {size}.": "/{c} means blocks of {size}. Divide {o4} by {size}, keep the whole part and multiply it by {size}.",
  "¿Cuál es el broadcast?": "What is the broadcast address?",
  "Primero saca la red ({o4} ÷ {size}, parte entera × {size}). Luego: red + {size} − 1. No olvides el − 1.": "First find the network ({o4} ÷ {size}, whole part × {size}). Then: network + {size} − 1. Don't forget the − 1.",
